    },
    {
      "en": "The only problem is that no sun can reach this room.",
      "zh": "唯一的问题是，这间屋子晒不到任何阳光。"
    },
    {
      "en": "Night is still hours away and yet everything is dark.",
      "zh": "离天黑还有好几个小时，可一切都已经漆黑一片。"
    },
    {
      "en": "...",
      "zh": "..."
    },
    {
      "en": "I try to move my legs forward and escape from the room but, as has become customary in times like these, I can not.",
      "zh": "我试着把腿往前挪、逃出这间屋子，但就像这种时候的惯例一样，我动不了。"
    },
    {
      "en": "I look down to inspect them to see if they’ve been pinned or nailed to the ground and discover that I have no form at all.",
      "zh": "我低头检查，想看看它们是不是被钉在了地上，却发现我根本没有形体。"
    },
    {
      "en": "I am a shadow now.",
      "zh": "我现在是一道影子。"
    },
    {
      "en": "But whose shadow am I?",
      "zh": "可我是谁的影子？"
